Guided by Yellow Emperor’s Classic of Internal Medicine (Huangdi Neijing), the Healing Series is created by both aroma designers and TCM （traditional Chinese medicine) doctors. 

This series is created to suit the rhythms of the day and the changing seasons. 
Westmount Wake is the morning blend;
Joyful Harmony is the afternoon blend;
Sweet Slumber is the night blend;
Midsummer bless is the Duan Wu Special blend.

Healing your soul deeply in all time of the day!
