@zhi_scalp_spa just opened their first North American location in Markham — and it’s Canada’s first cave-themed cocoon chair head spa. They use traditional Chinese medicine techniques, including an herbal head spa, with the option to add a purifying and hydrating ginger scalp treatment for just $9.

We tried their $116 combo treatment for two, which comes to only $58 per person — such a good deal. If you’re looking for a bestie date that detoxes, heals, and goes beyond simple relaxation, definitely check out Zhi Scalp Spa.

